  example "Concept (ru)" "Что такое Википедия?"
  example "Concept (hi)" "विकिपीडिया क्या है?"
  example "Concept (zh)" "维基百科是什么?"
  example "Concept in context" "What is IIR in machine learning?"
  example "Summarization" "Summarize this conversation"
  example "Brainstorming" "Brainstorm 5 small tools for link notation."
  example "Fact Q&A (en)" "Who wrote The Lord of the Rings?"
